==================================================
1. PRODUCT VISION AND IDENTITY
==================================================

PRODUCT NAME: CampusCompass

TAGLINE: Discover opportunities. Unlock your potential.

PRODUCT CATEGORY: AI-powered student opportunity discovery and management platform.

CORE PROBLEM:
Students frequently miss valuable opportunities because information is scattered across college notices, social media, posters, websites, messaging groups and emails. They struggle to identify relevant opportunities, understand eligibility criteria, remember deadlines and organise applications.

OUR SOLUTION:
CampusCompass creates a central intelligent platform that helps students discover opportunities, understand event information, evaluate their eligibility and track applications.

TARGET USERS:
- College and university students.
- Students searching for hackathons and coding competitions.
- Students looking for internships and scholarships.
- Students interested in workshops, conferences and volunteering.
- Students seeking academic and extracurricular development.

OPPORTUNITY CATEGORIES:
- Hackathons.
- Internships.
- Scholarships.
- Coding competitions.
- Workshops.
- Volunteering.
- Conferences.
- Research opportunities.
- Other student development opportunities.

ORIGINALITY REQUIREMENT:
