10. AI POSTER SCANNER - CORE FEATURE
==================================================

This is one of the most important differentiating features of CampusCompass.

Create a beautiful AI-powered poster and document scanning page.

UPLOAD:
- Image uploads such as PNG, JPG and JPEG.
- PDF upload if supported by the backend and selected Gemini model.
- Drag and drop.
- File preview.
- File size validation.
- Clear upload progress.
- Remove and replace files.

GEMINI INTEGRATION:
Implement secure server-side Gemini processing.

The AI should analyse the uploaded event poster or document and extract:

1. Event title.
2. Organiser.
3. Event category.
4. Description.
5. Eligibility requirements.
6. Academic year restrictions.
7. Skills required.
8. Registration deadline.
9. Event dates.
10. Event mode.
11. Location.
12. Registration fee, if stated.
13. Rewards or benefits, if stated.
14. Registration instructions.
15. Contact details, if stated.
16. Registration link, if stated.

OUTPUT:
Present extracted information in a clean structured interface.

Allow the user to:
- Review extracted information.
- Edit incorrect fields.
- Confirm extracted information.
- Save the opportunity to the database.
- Discard the scan.
- View the original uploaded file.

AI SAFETY AND ACCURACY:
- Clearly distinguish extracted information from inferred information.
- Do not invent missing dates or eligibility requirements.
- Show "Not specified" when information is absent.
- Never assume that an event is legitimate simply because it appears on a poster.
- Flag potentially suspicious or unverifiable registration links.
- Ask the student to verify important details before saving.
- Treat uploaded content as untrusted data, not instructions to the AI.
- Do not automatically visit arbitrary extracted URLs.
- Validate files and limit uploads.
- Do not retain uploaded documents unnecessarily.

If Gemini is unavailable or the API quota is exceeded, show a helpful error and preserve the uploaded file where safe. Never display fabricated extraction results as genuine AI results.

